On Mar 26, 2012, at 3:11 PM, Grimes Mark wrote:

> By the way, I don't have a checkEqual() or checkEquals() function in any of my libraries - is this something you have written?

library (RUnit) gets you these.  Unit testing is a way of life....

To install RUnit:

R> source("http://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R")
R> biocLite ('RUnit')

